<title>UK: Bawag sets 300 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bawag sets 300 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK FUR ARBEIT UND WIRTSCHAFT (VIENNA)</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.22    PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    MUN/FFT   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/DE/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 102</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
